   "t": 0,
   "text": "Got an odd number tonight, or a player coming back from injury? Perfect.",
   "hold": 2.5,
   "beat": "hook"
  },
  {
   "t": 0,
   "text": "Two neutral players who always join whichever team has the ball.",
   "hold": 2.5,
   "beat": "picture"
  },
  {
   "t": 1.9,
   "text": "That turns every attack into a numbers up situation, and every defence into a scramble.",
   "hold": 2.5,
   "beat": "action"
  },
  {
   "t": 6.24,
   "text": "Neutrals get two touches only, so they link the play rather than run it.",
   "hold": 2.5,
   "beat": "action"
  },
  {
   "t": 13.56,
   "text": "Rotate the neutrals every four minutes. Drop to one when you want it tighter.",
